Thank you so much.

2407
01:31:00,588 --> 01:31:03,424
She's different when she cooks
and when she gives her speech.

2408
01:31:03,491 --> 01:31:06,427
<i>-No Mala Acting Up!</i>
<i>-Someone else possessed her,</i>

2409
01:31:06,494 --> 01:31:09,230
-and she's now back to herself.
-You don't seem the same.

2410
01:31:09,297 --> 01:31:10,465
-How uncanny.
-Right?

2411
01:31:10,531 --> 01:31:13,367
-Please put a star on Chef Moon-jung!
-Three consecutive wins.

2412
01:31:13,434 --> 01:31:15,303
-Congratulations.
-Undefeated!

2413
01:31:15,369 --> 01:31:17,972
-She came three times and won three.
-Witch With a Wok!

2414
01:31:18,039 --> 01:31:19,507
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

2415
01:31:19,574 --> 01:31:22,643
Please take the tableware set too!

2416
01:31:22,710 --> 01:31:26,280
Congratulations, Moon-jung.
This is your third win in a row!

2417
01:31:26,948 --> 01:31:28,149
A round just for KARINA.

2418
01:31:28,216 --> 01:31:29,917
For the first time in the show's history,

2419
01:31:29,984 --> 01:31:31,886
they'll play as a team
with their right-hand men.

2420
01:31:31,953 --> 01:31:33,754
<i>It's exhilarating</i>
<i>when teamwork is perfect.</i>

2421
01:31:33,821 --> 01:31:34,956
<i>It's in 30-second intervals.</i>

2422
01:31:35,022 --> 01:31:36,390
-Thirty seconds?
-Thirty seconds?

2423
01:31:36,457 --> 01:31:37,792
-Grind the black pepper.
-Yes, Chef.

2424
01:31:37,859 --> 01:31:39,494
-Did you add lemon juice?
-I did.

2425
01:31:39,560 --> 01:31:40,728
Here comes his technique!

2426
01:31:40,795 --> 01:31:43,297
-That's so pretty!
-He's making a flower.

2427
01:31:43,664 --> 01:31:44,699
AMAZED

2428
01:31:44,765 --> 01:31:46,534
-Don't be nervous. We got this.
-Yes.

2429
01:31:46,601 --> 01:31:48,369
The teamwork of 14 years.

2430
01:31:48,436 --> 01:31:49,403
Salt!

2431
01:31:50,304 --> 01:31:51,606
SALT CROSS

2432
01:31:51,806 --> 01:31:53,207
PERFECT GROUP MOVE

2433
01:31:53,407 --> 01:31:55,309
NOT ONE TEAM WILL BACK DOWN

2434
01:31:55,543 --> 01:31:56,878
HOW WILL THE TEAM ROUND END?

2435
01:31:56,944 --> 01:31:58,579
This will be another fierce round.

2436
01:31:58,646 --> 01:32:00,047
Eun-yeong has won
all six rounds against him.

2437
01:32:00,114 --> 01:32:01,649
<i>Poong isn't good</i>
<i>against authentic Chinese chefs.</i>

2438
01:32:01,716 --> 01:32:03,150
This will be a hit-or-miss!

2439
01:32:03,217 --> 01:32:04,652
You can't give KARINA a stomachache.

2440
01:32:04,719 --> 01:32:06,287
<i>I'm sure today will be different.</i>

2441
01:32:06,354 --> 01:32:07,488
-What is that?
-Please!

2442
01:32:07,822 --> 01:32:08,789
IN SHOCK

2443
01:32:08,856 --> 01:32:09,690
TERROR

2444
01:32:09,957 --> 01:32:12,293
A VISUAL RIGHT OUT OF A WEBTOON

2445
01:32:12,560 --> 01:32:13,728
WHAT IS THIS BIZARRE DISH

2446
01:32:14,228 --> 01:32:16,030
THAT MADE KARINA SHUDDER?

2447
01:32:19,367 --> 01:32:20,835
She took a big bite.

2448
01:32:21,502 --> 01:32:23,938
She's like,
"Do I look like KARINA to you?"

2449
01:32:33,514 --> 01:32:38,286
Subtitle translation by: Eunsook Youn
